{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious disappearance of a hotel manager provides you and your partner in crime with the perfect opportunity for a heist. But be careful, the Austrian Alps hide a blood-chilling secret! You will need to rely on teamwork, stealth, and puzzle-solving skills to survive the night and escape with your lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/7bf8cf831e2faa61338d4d25ca86f9f6.avif?t=1764947118\" width=1169 height=161 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/918e39e63e671c18901805c6f5c76059.poster.avif?t=1764947118\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/918e39e63e671c18901805c6f5c76059.webm?t=1764947118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/918e39e63e671c18901805c6f5c76059.mp4?t=1764947118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two thieves break into an ski hotel deep in the Austrian Alps, seeking valuable loot. What begins as a simple heist quickly turns into a nightmare as you discover the hotel is haunted and inhabited by a Percht and other menacing creatures from Alpine folklore. Uncover the dark secret of this forsaken place by exploring its haunted halls, collecting clues, and piecing together the truth about what was really going on in this so called ski hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/4ed2b90c80278176d46a8277cef4aa28.avif?t=1764947118\" width=1169 height=161 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/6d3804a8fe8515395e58cfc9eb51fe63.poster.avif?t=1764947118\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/6d3804a8fe8515395e58cfc9eb51fe63.webm?t=1764947118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/6d3804a8fe8515395e58cfc9eb51fe63.mp4?t=1764947118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters lurk in the corridors, hunting anyone who dares to trespass. Work together to avoid them, hide in the shadows, and tread carefully to avoid detection. Every creaking floorboard and flickering light could give away your position, and a single wrong move could mean a terrifying encounter with creatures believed to exist only in folk tales. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/c3bb61560a951e9cd34b6c64fa4b6c68.avif?t=1764947118\" width=1169 height=161 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/7815e4e6388385753931019f18a9a9fc.poster.avif?t=1764947118\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/7815e4e6388385753931019f18a9a9fc.webm?t=1764947118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/7815e4e6388385753931019f18a9a9fc.mp4?t=1764947118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival depends on cooperation and wit as you solve intricate puzzles that guard the hotel's darkest secrets. Coordinate with your partner to unlock sealed areas, complete arcane rituals, and gather the items needed for your escape. Only by working together can you unleash the Alpine magic and make it out of the Alps alive.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3476240?t=1764947118","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/379a1720c8d2f5731c92aecc856058c5239c3de2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764947118","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/3965ef7f1f698405dbee4146a0e66a41d88a8df6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764947118","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/3965ef7f1f698405dbee4146a0e66a41d88a8df6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764947118","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4188550,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious disappearance of a hotel manager provides you and your partner in crime with the perfect opportunity for a heist. But be careful, the Austrian Alps hide a blood-chilling secret! You will need to rely on teamwork, stealth, and puzzle-solving skills to survive the night and escape with your lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/7bf8cf831e2faa61338d4d25ca86f9f6.avif?t=1764947118\" width=1169 height=161 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/918e39e63e671c18901805c6f5c76059.poster.avif?t=1764947118\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/918e39e63e671c18901805c6f5c76059.webm?t=1764947118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/918e39e63e671c18901805c6f5c76059.mp4?t=1764947118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two thieves break into an ski hotel deep in the Austrian Alps, seeking valuable loot. What begins as a simple heist quickly turns into a nightmare as you discover the hotel is haunted and inhabited by a Percht and other menacing creatures from Alpine folklore. Uncover the dark secret of this forsaken place by exploring its haunted halls, collecting clues, and piecing together the truth about what was really going on in this so called ski hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/4ed2b90c80278176d46a8277cef4aa28.avif?t=1764947118\" width=1169 height=161 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/6d3804a8fe8515395e58cfc9eb51fe63.poster.avif?t=1764947118\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/6d3804a8fe8515395e58cfc9eb51fe63.webm?t=1764947118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/6d3804a8fe8515395e58cfc9eb51fe63.mp4?t=1764947118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters lurk in the corridors, hunting anyone who dares to trespass. Work together to avoid them, hide in the shadows, and tread carefully to avoid detection. Every creaking floorboard and flickering light could give away your position, and a single wrong move could mean a terrifying encounter with creatures believed to exist only in folk tales. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/c3bb61560a951e9cd34b6c64fa4b6c68.avif?t=1764947118\" width=1169 height=161 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/7815e4e6388385753931019f18a9a9fc.poster.avif?t=1764947118\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/7815e4e6388385753931019f18a9a9fc.webm?t=1764947118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476240/extras/7815e4e6388385753931019f18a9a9fc.mp4?t=1764947118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival depends on cooperation and wit as you solve intricate puzzles that guard the hotel's darkest secrets. Coordinate with your partner to unlock sealed areas, complete arcane rituals, and gather the items needed for your escape. Only by working together can you unleash the Alpine magic and make it out of the Alps alive.</p>",